                                      QUERY PLAN                                       
---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
 Gather Motion 3:1  (slice1; segments: 3)  (cost=16.00..59.24 rows=528 width=32)
   ->  Bitmap Heap Scan on nestjsonb  (cost=16.00..52.20 rows=176 width=32)
         Recheck Cond: (j @> '{"c": 3}'::jsonb)
         ->  Bitmap Index Scan on nestjsonb_j_idx  (cost=0.00..15.96 rows=176 width=0)
               Index Cond: (j @> '{"c": 3}'::jsonb)
 Optimizer: Postgres query optimizer
(6 rows)

